sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Producer
  participant I as Ingress
  participant K as Kafka
  participant S as Spark task
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  participant CP as Checkpoint
  C->>I: Valid event with stable identity
  I->>K: Append raw event
  K-->>I: Configured durable acknowledgement
  I-->>C: 202 accepted
  K->>S: Raw record with partition and offset
  S->>D: Begin bounded chunk; lock attempt
  S->>D: Insert unique event; update projection; receipt
  D-->>S: Commit
  Note over S,CP: A crash here causes replay
  S->>CP: Successful batch progress
  K->>S: Redeliver after failure
  S->>D: Duplicate identity and receipt suppress effects
